NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses in Pontypridd and across Rhondda Cynon Taf. Every logo is designed from scratch — no AI tools, no off-the-shelf templates.

## Why a professional logo matters in Pontypridd

Local customers form opinions quickly. A professional, well-designed logo tells people your business is credible and worth trusting. It anchors everything else — your website, your van graphics, your social media profiles, your signage — giving your business a consistent, recognisable presence.

We work with businesses across Pontypridd and the surrounding Valleys, helping them look as professional as the work they deliver.

## What's included

- 5 initial logo concepts covering different directions
- Revisions until you're completely satisfied
- Brand colour palette and typography
- Brand guidelines document
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG

Full details on our [logo design service](/services/logo-design/) page.

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo is built in Adobe Illustrator — no AI-generated artwork, no stock icon libraries. Your logo is original and uniquely yours.

## Pair it with your website

Need a website to go with your new logo? We design and build websites alongside brand identities. See our [web design service](/services/web-design/).

